# A client without an X display, as a native Wayland application: typing
# with the synthetic Boshiamy-shaped table through the daemon's socket.
b 1 a <space> c 2 , <space>
b c d e f <space>
# Shift types English; Control+Space turns the input method off and on
S-h S-i <space> C-<space> a C-<space> a <space>
